            <title>[MAHOUT-1773] Fix cluster-syntheticcontrol.sh for HDFS synthax</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1773</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Added &apos;/&apos; to some lines, so it can check the root of the HDFS, where it&apos;s possible to use -mkdir, -put and others. Otherwise the example keeps failing (Tested on Hadoop 2.4.1).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
