                            <comment id="14746661" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 16 Sep 2015 01:50:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user edniemeyer commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/157#issuecomment-140596977&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/157#issuecomment-140596977&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Done! Sorry for not doing it before! &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/smile.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14994929" author="smarthi" created="Sat, 7 Nov 2015 02:32:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Mahout 0.11.1 Released on November 11, 2015, closing the issues.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15022783" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 23 Nov 2015 19:16:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user chu11 commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/157#issuecomment-159033734&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/157#issuecomment-159033734&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I recently hit this issue.  As a note for other users, I solved this issue an alternate way (of course my issue may have been different than the OP).  In my environment the user&apos;s home directory had not been created (/user/USERNAME), thus leading to an error when trying to do HDFS operations with a relative path.  The prefixing of the &quot;/&quot; is a more than suitable fix ensuring it works regardless of the user&apos;s environment setup.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15200589" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 17 Mar 2016 23:07:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user andrewmusselman commented on a diff in the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/157#discussion_r56592605&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/157#discussion_r56592605&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &amp;#8212; Diff: examples/bin/cluster-syntheticcontrol.sh &amp;#8212;&lt;br/&gt;
    @@ -66,13 +66,13 @@ if [ ! -f ${WORK_DIR}/synthetic_control.data ]; then&lt;br/&gt;
     fi&lt;br/&gt;
     if [ &quot;$HADOOP_HOME&quot; != &quot;&quot; ] &amp;amp;&amp;amp; [ &quot;$MAHOUT_LOCAL&quot; == &quot;&quot; ]; then&lt;br/&gt;
       echo &quot;Checking the health of DFS...&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;$DFS -ls&lt;br/&gt;
    +  $DFS -ls /&lt;br/&gt;
       if [ $? -eq 0 ];then &lt;br/&gt;
         echo &quot;DFS is healthy... &quot;&lt;br/&gt;
         echo &quot;Uploading Synthetic control data to HDFS&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
         $DFSRM testdata
	&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;End diff &amp;#8211;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    Shouldn&apos;t this have a slash in it too?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
